                                "sense_id": "6e184c80-db15-3aa3-a379-b27bab9f4a27",
                                "text": "1964, Qantas Airways, Qantas Airways Australia, Volumes 30-31, page 11,\nAgainst these riches you may buy a cup of the bitter, herbed black final coffee from a street vendor for ten piasters — about 1½d. — and step through an arch into the next sook devoted to cheap shoes and vegetables and as full of the turbaned poor as an Arabian Nights reality."
                            }
