                                "sense_id": "d51cb088-b64e-3841-b912-d70835e48ca0",
                                "text": "Ae hour's cauld will sook out seven years' heat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b585bdfc-7672-4cc7-91fd-c662171dbac8",
                                "sense_id": "d51cb088-b64e-3841-b912-d70835e48ca0",
                                "text": "Tibbie an' Andro bein' at that moment in the act o' whirlin' roond us were sooked into the vortex an' upset likewise, so that here were haill four o's sprawlin' i' the floor at ance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "214e97d2-21a2-4222-8704-f596d6706e57",
                                "sense_id": "d51cb088-b64e-3841-b912-d70835e48ca0",
                                "text": "You pursed your mooth in shape like O,\nAnd sook'd the air in, might and main"
                            }
                        ]
